+# Mining Eldervale: the mining destination
+
+Mining Eldervale is Aetherion's flagship gather isle. On top of every strike it stacks a work song, geodes you crack open by hand, per-ore mastery, contracts, depth, events, critters and hazards. The Deep Forge turns ore into permanent **Forge Marks**. Under all of it sits the **Amethyst Mine** (`/amethyst`, the daily-reset dig world known as The Veins), which is the prestige layer: Resonance, Shardlings, Geode Hearts and Heartstones.
+
+It follows the same pattern as Farming Eldervale (`AetherionFarming` `isle/*`) and Fishing Eldervale (`AetherionFishing` `isle/*`): a single router, profiles, events, menus, compass, cast and DEV pages.
+
+Ownership:
+
+- **AetherionMining** owns the isle, the Amethyst Mine and every loop.
+- **AetherionItems** owns payouts (HarvestListener), skills, the blueprint forge GUI and ritual, and the DEV pages.
+- **AetherionCore** only gains default methods on `MiningAccess`.
+
+No locked system is touched: Boosters, vials, the Custom Anvil / `BoosterSocketMenu`, ranks and RankBadge, Blossom Blade, Gravwell Cleaver, ShutdownCountdown, Farming Eldervale and Helios all stay as they are.
