+
+### What one strike does (isle)
+
+```
+strike ─ mastery (+2) · depth record/band card · contracts (deep shifts) · events (Rich Vein, Troll Run) · shift streak
+       ─ (hand-mined only) Strike Rhythm → Seam Chain → Seam Burst (→ Stonejaw?) · Crystal Find roll
+       ─ critters (mites in the heat, moths in the grotto) · hazards (strain → cave-in) · depth XP
+payout ─ Items asks back: ore Fortune = mastery + ledger + rhythm + ration + depth + streak + Assay Plate
+                          ore Power  = mastery IV/VII + Heartstone crown (that ore only, isle/Amethyst only)
+                          speed      = rhythm + ration + Tempered Head (never gates)
+                          extra drop = Rich Vein
+```
+
+In the Amethyst Mine a strike feeds mastery, Amethyst shifts, Resonance, Shardlings and Crystal Finds (Veins odds, Heartstones possible). Outside both, only mastery counts, at half weight.
+
+### Forge Marks (costs)
+
+Costs are compressed/compacted ore Items ids, coins and specimens, gated by Forge rank. There's no second currency.
+
+| Mark | I | II | III | IV | V |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Tempered Head (+4 speed/lvl) | 4 C.Iron, 2k | 8 C.Iron, 4 C.Gold, 6k · Apprentice | 16 C.Iron, 8 C.Gold, 2 C.Diamond, 15k · Journeyman | 1 Compacted Iron, 16 C.Gold, 8 C.Diamond, 40k · Smith | 2 Compacted Iron, 1 Compacted Gold, 24 C.Diamond, 120k, 1 Perfect · Master |
+| Assay Plate (+4 ore Fortune/lvl) | 4 C.Copper, 2 C.Lapis, 2.5k | 8 C.Copper, 6 C.Lapis, 2 C.Redstone, 7.5k, 1 Rough | 16 C.Lapis, 8 C.Redstone, 4 C.Gold, 20k, 1 Flawless | 1 Compacted Lapis, 16 C.Gold, 4 C.Emerald, 50k, 1 Perfect | 1 Compacted Gold, 16 C.Emerald, 150k, **1 Heartstone** |
+| Lamp Core (finds ×1.08/1.16/1.25) | 6 C.Redstone, 3k · Apprentice | 12 C.Redstone, 6 C.Lapis, 12k, 1 Flawless · Journeyman | 1 Compacted Redstone, 16 C.Lapis, 40k, 2 Perfect · Smith | | |
+| Seam Hook (Seam −1/lvl, floor 4) | 8 C.Copper, 2 C.Emerald, 4k · Apprentice | 16 C.Copper, 6 C.Emerald, 12k · Journeyman | 1 Compacted Copper, 12 C.Emerald, 35k · Smith | | |
+| Heat Ward (−20% hazard dmg/lvl) | 8 C.Coal, 2k | 24 C.Coal, 16 Obsidian, 6k · Apprentice | 1 Compacted Coal, 64 Obsidian, 20k · Journeyman | | |
+
+Reputation needed per rank: Apprentice 100 · Journeyman 500 · Smith 1,500 · Master 4,000 · Forgelord 10,000.
+
+Ways to earn it:
+
+- Forging a Mark: 25 × level + coins / 400.
+- A blueprint ritual at the Forgehand: 40 × tier.
+- A contract: 8, or 12 for a shift.
+- A Stonejaw kill: 50.
+- A Stonejaw's Jaw handed to Hollis: 60.
+- A consumable: 3.
