+## 6. Click-test sheet
+
+Setup: deploy Core + Items + Mining + Hub together (see §7), then join as op.
+
+1. **Arrive.** Take the Origin slime pad or `/mining`. You should get the welcome lines and an arrow to Old Wick. Walking into The Landing shows a discovery title (1/25).
+2. **Tour.** Right-click Old Wick: the map board lists 25 places (unknown ones are grey). Click a known one to get the compass arrow and height hint. `/mineisle tour` walks you to Otto → Nan → Ilse → Brann → Hollis, each paying a little XP.
+3. **Rhythm.** Mine ore steadily in the North Pit. The bossbar climbs Steady Pick → In the Seam → Anvil Chorus with the notes rising. Same ore 8× in a row gives a Seam Burst (sparks, extra ore).
+4. **Crystal Find.** Run `/mineisle dev find:diamond:perfect`. The geode grows out of the rock. Hit it with a pickaxe until it cracks. You get the specimen, a cabinet line and possibly an isle record (the Record Board at the Assay Office updates).
+5. **Depth.** Walk down the Crucible Shaft from the Deep Forge. Band cards show at Y 82, 56 and 26, and first-time titles pay XP. In the Undercroft with no lantern, Darkness pulses. With a lantern in your off-hand, it doesn't.
+6. **Cave-in.** Hammer one spot below Y 56. First you get dust and a warning, then the ⚠ CAVE-IN title. Step out within 2 s and loose ore pays you. Stay and you take about 20% max HP plus blindness. `/mineisle dev hazard:cavein` forces it.
+7. **Heat.** Stand in the Emberseam (`/mineisle go emberseam`). The heat bar climbs, you get Slowness at 30 and burn at 65, and water resets it.
+8. **Critters.** `/mineisle dev critter:stonejaw` spawns it. Watch the ring telegraph, then the slam. It takes 16 hits. It drops the jaw, ore and a Flawless+ geode, and announces to the isle. Hand the jaw to Hollis for 2,500 coins and +60 rep. Cinder Mites bite and burn. Gloam Moths flee; catching one gives Gloam-lit.
+9. **Contracts.** At Otto, deliver a hand-in. You get coins, XP and +8 Forge rep. Shifts count as you mine.
+10. **Hearth.** Cook a Miner's Pasty at Nan (64 coal and 32 copper), eat it, and check that ore Fortune rises in `/stats`.
+11. **Deep Forge.** At Brann, `/mineisle dev forge:rep:1000` first. Forge Tempered Head I: you get a title, the crucible erupts and the bellows pump faster. Craft a Prospector's Flare and snap it: ores within 10 blocks glow for 15 s, visible only to you.
+12. **Forgehand.** Upgrade a blueprint tool with an Upgrade Stone at the Forgehand. The braziers around the anvil flare for the whole ritual, the Deep Forge roars, and +40 rep per tier is paid. At Tier IV the whole isle gets a shout.
+13. **Amethyst Mine.** `/amethyst` shows the intro lines. Find a geode (calcite shell) and break crystal. The Resonance bar goes Humming → Singing Walls (Shardlings appear and zap you after an END_ROD beam) → Shatterpoint → 100. It shatters: you take damage, Shardlings spawn, and sometimes a Geode Heart is left (crack it for a Heartstone chance). Below Y 0 at Mining < 20 you get the Violet Deep hum.
+14. **DEV.** DEV → Mining Island (page 2 on this branch's DevMenu, CAT_WORLDS once the IA splice is in). Check teleports, place the cast at presets, start and stop events, the progression buttons, and that Farming/Fishing Island, Special Sets, Ambient and Wipe are all still there.
+15. **Regression.** Mining outside the isle (Ore Ridge, Mines) pays exactly what it did before, with only mastery counting. Farming and Fishing Eldervale are unchanged. `/amethyst` and `/deepmines` still work.
